  "method": "Join every generator's approved list on mva.drugs.names.base_name; the statistic is the number of drugs named by >= 2 generators; the null replaces each list by an equal-sized draw without replacement from its own approved universe, 10000 draws, numpy default_rng seed 20260925; one-sided p = (1 + #null >= observed) / (1 + draws); repeated with [] removed from every list and universe. K1 from the Drug Repurposing Hub MOA, K2 by re-running entry 152's tools/patient_safety.py (labels, faers, table), its label half only (no patient genome), K3 from the screen-wide sweep. A survivor converges and fails no check.",
